{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1496825-help-making-my-first-vtm-character-5th-edition-thinblood-mafia-partyboy","id":1496825,"title":"Help making my first vtm character? (5th edition, thinblood mafia partyboy)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-11T10:03:40-08:00","id":1496825,"title":"Help making my first vtm character? (5th edition, thinblood mafia partyboy)","content":"Howdy! My first game of vampire the masquerade is tomorrow night. I had a character sheet prepped. But while talking with the gm, we decide to make some significant changes to my character, and I'm still trying to figure out how to build him now. So I would appreciate your advice!<br /> <br /> Here is the backstory. (Though I am still learning the lore of VTM, I might be misrepresenting the gms suggestions, if something sounds wrong lorewise, please tell me.) The year is 1999, and the setting is New York. Tony made a living for himself by being on bad reality TV and dating celebrities to appear in gossip mags. Just a horrible party boy. A large part of his notoriety comes from the fact that people know he is the son of a local crimelord. So he uses his father's reputation to make a stink, and people generally find him unpleasant.<br /> <br /> One day while at a bar, he passed out, And woke up a thin blood, not knowing what had happened.<br /> <br /> He wandered the streets for a while and met a group of anarchs who taught him thin-blood alchemy (He picked up the skills quickly because of his familiarity with certain parts of his father's business). However, Tony annoyed them enough that they kicked him out.<br /> <br /> He returned to the bar and immediately got spotted by the group of vampires that frequent it. The vampires brought him to the vampire government, which branded him and told him they would kill him if he stepped out of line. It turned out the bar was part of the domain of a flesh-warping vampire that ran a modeling agency; the vampire government told her that Tony was her responsibility, so she employed him as a model. (all the pcs are models). Then the campaign starts!<br /> <br /> I would appreciate any advice you have for making this character! (Especially the thing blood parts... those are weird!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27626-rfkannen","name":"rfkannen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T12:25:49-08:00","id":1496842,"title":"","content":"I'd downplay the alchemy as miss and focus on more conventional (crime centric) abilities but otherwise seems a solid concept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T13:26:56-08:00","id":1496845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1496825-help-making-my-first-vtm-character-5th-edition-thinblood-mafia-partyboy?p=1496842#post1496842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd downplay the alchemy as miss and focus on more conventional (crime centric) abilities but otherwise seems a solid concept.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you! I mostly picked thinblood for story reasons, but isn't thinblood alchemy their whole thing?<br /> <br /> Any other ideas for other mechanical niches my character fill?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27626-rfkannen","name":"rfkannen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}